WEBVTT

01:26.140 --> 01:31.610
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.550
[Episode 27: Lianyi Is the Swordswoman]

02:04.410 --> 02:08.330
♫ It's dark but friends are not back ♫

02:08.540 --> 02:09.825
My name is Shu Yanan.

02:09.399 --> 02:13.420
♫ The night breeze can't understand sadness and heartache ♫

02:09.929 --> 02:11.410
Tell me your name too.

02:11.990 --> 02:13.440
Yun Xiang.

02:14.110 --> 02:17.870
♫ Rain falls all night long and I stay awake ♫

02:19.090 --> 02:23.420
♫ The night rain can't conceal the sorrow ♫

02:23.660 --> 02:27.910
♫ Memory is a book ♫

02:28.469 --> 02:33.090
♫ Who wrote all those stories? ♫

02:33.440 --> 02:37.690
♫ Without realizing it ♫

02:38.060 --> 02:42.636
♫ So many years have passed ♫

02:42.660 --> 02:46.060
♫ Flowers fall into the garden ♫

02:46.420 --> 02:51.536
♫ Dear friends, why haven't we met earlier? ♫

02:51.560 --> 03:00.230
♫ Destiny is so cruel ♫

03:01.190 --> 03:04.156
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

03:04.180 --> 03:06.546
♫ How many old friends are gone? ♫

03:06.320 --> 03:08.330
Leaving me,

03:06.570 --> 03:11.426
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon. People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

03:10.780 --> 03:15.670
the day of yesterday would not stay on.

03:11.450 --> 03:13.806
♫ We let go of everything ♫

03:13.830 --> 03:16.186
♫ In the past ♫

03:16.210 --> 03:21.020
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

03:17.740 --> 03:19.710
Troubling my mind...

03:21.610 --> 03:24.506
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

03:24.530 --> 03:26.945
♫ How many old friends are gone? ♫

03:26.969 --> 03:31.736
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon. People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

03:31.760 --> 03:33.976
♫ We let go of everything ♫

03:34.000 --> 03:36.556
♫ In the past ♫

03:36.580 --> 03:41.366
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

03:41.390 --> 03:43.766
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

03:43.790 --> 03:46.066
♫ How many old friends are gone? ♫

03:46.090 --> 03:50.996
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon. People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

03:51.020 --> 03:53.316
♫ We let go of everything ♫

03:53.340 --> 03:55.766
♫ In the past ♫

03:55.790 --> 04:00.876
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

04:00.900 --> 04:11.020
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

04:24.990 --> 04:29.276
[Shao's Residence]

04:28.850 --> 04:30.300
Your Highness,

04:30.670 --> 04:32.196
you've had a great time

04:32.220 --> 04:33.766
in Nandu.

04:33.790 --> 04:36.150
When are you going back?

04:36.720 --> 04:39.480
Not now. I haven't enjoyed myself to the full.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.746
Besides,

04:40.770 --> 04:42.850
even Father didn't urge me to go back to Yangzhou.

04:43.360 --> 04:46.006
Prince Fu was ordered to meet His Majesty in Beidu.

04:46.030 --> 04:47.996
I'm afraid he doesn't have time to care about you.

04:48.020 --> 04:49.306
I don't care.

04:49.330 --> 04:50.556
Since Father didn't urge me,

04:50.580 --> 04:52.189
you should just leave me alone.

04:55.510 --> 04:57.040
But your words make sense.

04:57.080 --> 04:59.076
Since Father went to Beidu to meet with His Majesty,

04:59.100 --> 05:00.700
I haven't heard from him.

05:01.950 --> 05:04.870
I wonder if someone complained about him again.

05:05.870 --> 05:08.180
I hope His Majesty wouldn't give him a hard time.

05:13.890 --> 05:15.606
His Majesty is wise and benevolent.

05:15.630 --> 05:17.680
Prince Fu is also conscientious.

05:17.730 --> 05:19.680
Your Highness may rest assured.

05:22.700 --> 05:24.786
Everyone wants to be born into a royal family.

05:24.810 --> 05:26.460
They think we're all carefree.

05:27.630 --> 05:31.026
But they are unaware that many complex

05:31.050 --> 05:32.590
and subtle relationships are involved.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.360
People are unpredictable.

05:36.210 --> 05:39.320
One careless move may lead to a tragedy.

05:41.370 --> 05:43.525
Your Highness has lived comfortably since you were young.

05:43.549 --> 05:45.500
I didn't expect you to think of these.

05:46.540 --> 05:48.640
I know because I've seen enough of it.

05:49.370 --> 05:50.256
That's why

05:50.280 --> 05:52.816
I want to learn more from you.

05:52.840 --> 05:55.760
Perhaps I can share Father's burden in the future.

06:07.550 --> 06:09.000
Sir.

06:09.310 --> 06:10.760
Tell me.

06:14.230 --> 06:16.280
What should I do?

06:17.110 --> 06:19.250
I know that you can neither disobey His Majesty's orders

06:19.480 --> 06:21.046
nor betray the benefactor who has brought you new life.

06:21.070 --> 06:22.206
That's indeed a dilemma for you.

06:22.230 --> 06:23.430
But the Princess will eventually figure out

06:23.430 --> 06:24.906
the purpose of our trip.

06:24.930 --> 06:26.500
I beg for your prudence, My Lord.

06:27.140 --> 06:30.500
I will never forget Prince Fu's kindness.

06:31.230 --> 06:32.826
As an imperial guard,

06:32.850 --> 06:35.670
I shall do my best to defend the royal power

06:35.730 --> 06:38.446
and seek peace for the people.

06:38.220 --> 06:43.170
[Imperial Guardsmen Command, To protect His Majesty]

06:38.470 --> 06:40.330
If anyone disobeys His Majesty,

06:40.930 --> 06:42.810
it won't be tolerated

06:43.990 --> 06:45.550
and I shall uphold justice.

06:47.080 --> 06:48.530
We should look for a chance.

06:48.670 --> 06:51.210
No matter what, send Her Highness back first.

06:51.570 --> 06:53.460
She has been naive since she was young.

06:53.740 --> 06:55.689
She shouldn't be involved.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.156
Understood.

06:57.180 --> 06:58.086
Lord Liu.

06:58.110 --> 07:00.070
A man named Yun Xiang is here to see you.

07:05.110 --> 07:06.126
How was it?

07:06.150 --> 07:07.596
Is there any news so soon?

07:07.620 --> 07:08.616
Sir,

07:08.640 --> 07:10.386
I came here to inform you that

07:10.410 --> 07:12.360
our plan needs to be amended.

07:12.940 --> 07:13.836
Go on.

07:13.860 --> 07:15.086
The first deal

07:15.110 --> 07:16.880
may not be completed for the time being.

07:17.050 --> 07:20.000
But the second deal will be finished tonight.

07:22.660 --> 07:23.756
Sir,

07:23.780 --> 07:25.076
undue delay may bring trouble.

07:25.100 --> 07:26.700
I hope you can deploy troops immediately.

07:40.470 --> 07:41.226
What are you panicking about?

07:41.250 --> 07:43.206
We're surrounded by soldiers.

07:43.230 --> 07:44.680
What?

07:45.090 --> 07:46.856
Kou Lianyi is such an idiot.

07:46.880 --> 07:48.206
It's impossible to break through the siege.

07:48.230 --> 07:50.280
I'll distract the soldiers for you.

07:50.510 --> 07:51.756
It's too risky to take the silver certificates

07:51.780 --> 07:53.370
converted with the stolen money along with you.

07:53.580 --> 07:55.030
Give me the silver certificates.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.840
If I can't be back anymore,

08:01.870 --> 08:03.320
Young Master,

08:04.740 --> 08:06.310
please don't forget Yuewu.

08:46.000 --> 08:46.906
Uncle.

08:46.930 --> 08:48.510
Whom are we here to arrest?

08:49.090 --> 08:50.770
You'll know soon.

09:01.480 --> 09:02.930
Let's go.

09:13.800 --> 09:17.140
It looks like the person has lived here for a few days.

09:21.350 --> 09:23.070
Sir, one has escaped.

09:32.350 --> 09:33.870
Watch your step!

09:36.990 --> 09:38.870
Get out of the way!

09:39.830 --> 09:41.366
There...

09:41.390 --> 09:42.840
Go!

09:58.710 --> 10:00.160
Search!

10:25.110 --> 10:26.146
Master asked me to inform you

10:26.170 --> 10:28.170
that blood must be atoned for with blood.

10:28.220 --> 10:29.670
With just you?

10:35.150 --> 10:36.600
Let's go.

10:37.190 --> 10:38.636
Wait for me here.

10:38.660 --> 10:39.486
Let's go.

10:39.510 --> 10:40.960
Uncle.

11:26.590 --> 11:28.040
Uncle!

11:34.610 --> 11:36.060
Uncle, help me!

11:54.240 --> 11:56.400
How dare you use the Princess as bait?

11:56.460 --> 11:57.590
It happened suddenly. I...

11:57.590 --> 11:59.040
Stop quibbling!

11:59.190 --> 12:00.086
Uncle,

12:00.110 --> 12:01.276
it's not Li Bo's fault.

12:01.300 --> 12:02.780
It was my idea.

12:03.270 --> 12:05.100
You're not allowed to go anywhere else tomorrow.

12:05.440 --> 12:07.770
Just stay with the Princess in the courtyard.

12:58.350 --> 12:59.800
Calm down.

13:00.050 --> 13:01.236
Please don't be mad at me anymore.

13:01.260 --> 13:04.050
Consider it a small gift to compensate you.

13:12.460 --> 13:15.070
I really like your outfit today.

13:15.330 --> 13:20.280
This is exactly as the saying goes, "Feminine charm concealing chivalry,

13:20.750 --> 13:24.640
tenderness veiling a jade sword's blade."

13:30.710 --> 13:33.260
People from the Yuntai Sect are forbidden to fall in love.

13:33.400 --> 13:35.450
Perhaps I was already defeated

13:36.450 --> 13:37.980
when we first met in Baiju Town.

13:49.740 --> 13:52.910
I hope all of this can end soon.

13:54.700 --> 13:56.770
I want to stay with you like this forever

13:57.880 --> 13:59.850
and not care about the chaos outside.

14:19.110 --> 14:20.560
Master.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.990
Miss Ke.

14:23.190 --> 14:24.486
Look at the dress.

14:24.510 --> 14:26.250
Is it of top quality?

14:27.110 --> 14:28.736
She only wore it once.

14:28.760 --> 14:30.066
Why don't we give it to Tianhu?

14:30.090 --> 14:31.466
That's right.

14:31.490 --> 14:33.710
How could Tianhu wear other people's old clothes?

14:38.430 --> 14:39.880
Throw these away.

14:40.590 --> 14:42.040
Master.

14:52.760 --> 14:53.716
Dingyuan Pill.

14:53.740 --> 14:54.796
It's so precious

14:54.820 --> 14:56.486
that it's hard to buy but cures all poisons.

14:56.510 --> 14:58.010
I'll give it to Ten Taels of Gold.

14:58.570 --> 15:00.250
By the way, Miss Ke,

15:00.350 --> 15:02.206
her leaving is also beneficial to you.

15:02.230 --> 15:03.706
The house you're living in down there is too small.

15:03.730 --> 15:05.446
From now on, you'll move up here

15:05.470 --> 15:06.950
and live in this room.

15:08.460 --> 15:10.040
I mean it.

15:13.010 --> 15:15.420
All right, I'm tired today.

15:15.530 --> 15:16.836
I'm now going back to have some rest.

15:16.860 --> 15:18.450
Please don't disturb me.

15:23.090 --> 15:24.996
Also, please go to Mingyu

15:25.020 --> 15:27.166
and tell him to go to Guanghui Bank

15:27.190 --> 15:28.660
and meet Mr. Mo tomorrow morning.

15:43.310 --> 15:44.486
Mr. Mo,

15:44.510 --> 15:45.866
why do you keep sighing today?

15:45.890 --> 15:47.356
I've never seen you like this.

15:47.380 --> 15:48.736
I've been keeping a low profile all my life.

15:48.760 --> 15:50.166
That was the only secret I had,

15:50.190 --> 15:52.630
but Yun Xiang revealed it all.

15:52.780 --> 15:55.136
We need to verify the authenticity of the tributary cloth later.

15:55.160 --> 15:57.050
It's better for me to do it.

16:01.230 --> 16:02.680
Mr. Mo,

16:02.800 --> 16:05.190
how did you find out the whereabouts of the tributary cloth?

16:05.710 --> 16:07.310
Don't ask anything you shouldn't.

16:08.190 --> 16:09.286
Rest assured.

16:09.310 --> 16:10.906
I know what to

16:10.930 --> 16:12.066
and what not to say later.

16:12.090 --> 16:13.296
That's good.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.726
If this matter is exposed,

16:14.750 --> 16:16.156
not only will I be beheaded,

16:16.180 --> 16:18.090
but your Su family will also suffer a lot.

16:20.450 --> 16:22.570
Whom are we meeting with today?

16:23.780 --> 16:25.760
Fine, I won't ask anymore.

16:45.470 --> 16:47.136
Remember, don't talk as you wish.

16:47.160 --> 16:48.610
Understood.

16:55.500 --> 16:56.950
Please.

17:11.620 --> 17:12.996
How many do you have?

17:13.020 --> 17:13.996
I'll take them all.

17:14.020 --> 17:15.470
You didn't even inquire about the price.

17:15.749 --> 17:17.199
I can afford it.

17:17.489 --> 17:18.886
Come again tomorrow.

17:18.910 --> 17:20.360
Wait.

17:21.040 --> 17:22.596
I have to ask

17:22.620 --> 17:25.020
where the goods came from.

17:25.560 --> 17:27.036
According to the rules of our business,

17:27.060 --> 17:29.060
we don't question the source of the goods.

17:30.490 --> 17:33.100
I've known Guan for years.

17:33.140 --> 17:35.796
Even if I ask a question, it's no big deal.

17:35.820 --> 17:36.876
I'll ask you one last time.

17:36.900 --> 17:38.350
Where did you get the goods?

17:41.100 --> 17:43.600
No problem. I'll fulfil your wishes.

17:56.790 --> 17:58.830
What kind of a fool

17:59.110 --> 18:00.970
would be looking for trouble here?

18:06.830 --> 18:08.346
Isn't this Mr. Mo?

18:08.370 --> 18:09.486
Guan.

18:09.510 --> 18:11.000
How have you been?

18:18.260 --> 18:19.710
Come on.

18:21.670 --> 18:23.396
Stop beating around the bush.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.746
Do you really want the goods

18:24.770 --> 18:27.966
or do you have other intentions?

18:27.990 --> 18:30.136
Fine, I'll cut to the chase.

18:30.160 --> 18:31.646
I do have another purpose.

18:31.670 --> 18:34.196
I want to know who owns the goods

18:34.220 --> 18:36.076
and where those people are.

18:36.100 --> 18:38.226
Can you let me into the details?

18:38.250 --> 18:41.026
I didn't want to take over the hot potato.

18:41.050 --> 18:42.606
It's hard to get rid of it.

18:42.630 --> 18:45.330
Only the royal members of the Japanese dare to accept it.

18:45.670 --> 18:48.270
But you know how stingy those Japanese are.

18:48.850 --> 18:52.016
But now that I think about it, it's a business without cost.

18:52.040 --> 18:53.366
So I bit the bullet.

18:53.390 --> 18:54.970
A business without cost?

18:55.310 --> 18:57.110
That means someone used the goods

18:57.130 --> 18:58.566
as a pledge.

18:58.590 --> 19:01.390
Did they come over to you?

19:03.590 --> 19:04.846
Mo,

19:04.870 --> 19:06.720
don't force me to break the rules.

19:07.110 --> 19:09.446
You may have outsmarted yourself.

19:09.470 --> 19:11.076
I think Master Guan has

19:11.100 --> 19:13.060
only hundreds of bolts of tributary cloth.

19:13.140 --> 19:15.190
If you agree to hand them over,

19:15.620 --> 19:17.696
I promise to sell you

19:17.720 --> 19:19.650
5,000 bolts at a low price in a year.

19:21.420 --> 19:24.980
How arrogant you are!

19:25.100 --> 19:27.206
You offered 5,000 bolts of tributary cloth without hesitation.

19:27.230 --> 19:29.116
With that arrogance,

19:29.140 --> 19:31.840
are you from the Su family in Nandu?

19:32.310 --> 19:33.950
Judging from your age,

19:34.820 --> 19:37.900
are you the second son of the Su family?

19:42.200 --> 19:45.220
Great. You came at a good time.

19:46.030 --> 19:48.156
Thank you for the gift, Mr. Mo.

19:48.180 --> 19:50.246
I'll let my fellows down if I don't accept it.

19:50.270 --> 19:51.496
Guan, listen.

19:51.520 --> 19:52.616
Don't...

19:52.640 --> 19:53.966
Master Guan.

19:53.990 --> 19:57.110
How much do you want after kidnapping me?

19:58.370 --> 20:00.250
Let me put it this way.

20:00.340 --> 20:02.586
I'm not only the second son of the Su family

20:02.610 --> 20:05.510
but also the chairman of the entire Nandu Chamber of Commerce.

20:05.620 --> 20:09.150
It turns out that I'm more valuable than you thought.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.090
Interesting.

20:12.460 --> 20:13.616
I've never seen a hostage

20:13.640 --> 20:16.240
raise the price for himself.

20:18.430 --> 20:20.270
If you cooperate with me,

20:20.440 --> 20:23.486
I'm sure I can double the profit

20:23.510 --> 20:25.310
Mr. Mo promised you.

20:34.270 --> 20:36.860
Okay, see you.

20:37.630 --> 20:39.080
Come on. Let's go.

20:40.670 --> 20:43.696
Mr. Mo, why didn't you tell me earlier that we were meeting the pirates?

20:43.720 --> 20:45.230
We were just here to inquire.

20:45.250 --> 20:47.310
I didn't expect you to be so impulsive.

20:49.240 --> 20:51.186
Are you really going to work with Guan?

20:51.210 --> 20:53.950
Let's get out of the gate alive first.

20:54.420 --> 20:57.736
Besides, if they really want to cooperate with the Su family,

20:57.760 --> 20:59.610
they must kidnap me again.

21:00.770 --> 21:02.410
The pirates

21:02.600 --> 21:04.310
have no future at all.

21:04.450 --> 21:06.930
I don't mind giving them an empty promise.

21:07.290 --> 21:09.816
You have indeed learned a lot from Yun Xiang.

21:09.840 --> 21:11.880
You'll perform well as the chairman in the future.

21:12.110 --> 21:13.110
A strong general does not lead weak soldiers.

21:13.110 --> 21:14.836
An accomplished master has no unqualified disciples.

21:14.860 --> 21:16.310
By the way, Mr. Mo,

21:16.530 --> 21:18.600
do you know what's wrong with Yun recently?

21:18.750 --> 21:20.420
What's wrong with him?

21:20.870 --> 21:23.210
He seems to be mad at Miss Shu.

21:23.270 --> 21:24.726
In the past, even if they had disputes,

21:24.750 --> 21:26.200
they wouldn't be like this.

21:26.830 --> 21:28.416
Miss Shu is acting weird too.

21:28.440 --> 21:30.166
There's something behind everything she says lately.

21:30.190 --> 21:32.246
It's like saying goodbye.

21:32.270 --> 21:33.720
Saying goodbye?

21:34.310 --> 21:36.216
Please help me ask him

21:36.240 --> 21:37.850
to come to Guanghui Bank as soon as possible.

21:59.030 --> 22:00.480
Mr. Yun.

22:02.870 --> 22:04.320
Mr. Yun.

22:04.510 --> 22:06.076
I've prepared hangover soup for you.

22:06.100 --> 22:07.780
Please get up and have some.

22:10.110 --> 22:11.710
Hangover soup?

22:13.190 --> 22:15.620
You should prepare wine for me to get sober.

22:15.950 --> 22:17.226
Go and get it.

22:17.250 --> 22:19.250
If you have something on your mind,

22:19.540 --> 22:21.370
you can pour it out to me.

22:22.790 --> 22:27.210
It's not a good idea to drown your sorrows in drinks.

22:28.150 --> 22:30.470
I've been doing well lately.

22:30.930 --> 22:32.410
I have no sorrows at all.

22:42.380 --> 22:43.830
Leave it to me.

22:53.270 --> 22:55.260
You're back so soon.

23:07.510 --> 23:09.110
The wine is good, Yun.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.406
Unfortunately,

23:17.430 --> 23:21.026
it's a pity that you had such a wonderful time

23:21.050 --> 23:22.500
but not a beautiful lady by your side.

23:25.470 --> 23:26.606
Listen.

23:26.630 --> 23:28.316
Jin has called Tianhu

23:28.340 --> 23:29.566
to go to Jishan Hall.

23:29.590 --> 23:32.166
Yet you are pestering Menglan every day.

23:32.190 --> 23:34.100
Are you still going to operate Liansheng House?

23:34.590 --> 23:37.410
Listen, I'm also one of the owners.

23:37.600 --> 23:39.510
Go ahead and manage your business.

23:40.100 --> 23:41.550
Leave me alone.

23:41.930 --> 23:44.326
You're occupying my place.

23:44.350 --> 23:46.590
Aren't you afraid that Miss Shu will return and get even with you?

23:47.630 --> 23:51.080
Or she won't come back anymore?

23:56.150 --> 23:58.030
Do you still remember what you said

23:58.030 --> 23:59.930
when I was trapped in love?

24:00.200 --> 24:01.876
Why are you so helpless

24:01.900 --> 24:03.560
when it comes to yourself?

24:05.890 --> 24:07.600
I'm different from you.

24:07.670 --> 24:09.220
How?

24:12.750 --> 24:14.200
Forget it.

24:14.530 --> 24:16.630
Even you can't figure it out,

24:16.990 --> 24:18.840
let alone me.

24:19.310 --> 24:21.066
But you need to get up quickly.

24:21.090 --> 24:23.040
Mr. Mo asked you to go there as soon as possible.

24:28.390 --> 24:29.900
Have you found the tributary cloth?

24:30.940 --> 24:31.746
Yes.

24:31.770 --> 24:35.096
The soldiers used the tributary cloth as a pledge

24:35.120 --> 24:37.760
to become pirates under Master Guan.

24:38.050 --> 24:40.100
But I've made a deal with them.

24:40.130 --> 24:42.110
Master Guan promised to hand over the soldiers.

24:47.030 --> 24:49.310
It tastes so bad. That's it.

24:55.190 --> 24:56.640
Yun.

24:57.360 --> 24:59.136
I won't ask about you and Miss Shu.

24:59.160 --> 25:01.336
But when you want a drink, can you invite me?

25:01.360 --> 25:02.810
I'm always at your disposal.

25:21.350 --> 25:22.796
You won't tell me if I don't ask, will you?

25:22.820 --> 25:24.820
How dare you hide it from me for so long?

25:25.420 --> 25:27.556
Yun Xiang knows everything about me.

25:27.580 --> 25:30.216
He's already obsessed with Shu Yanan.

25:30.240 --> 25:32.390
Who knows what he told her?

25:34.900 --> 25:36.050
Since you're sure

25:36.070 --> 25:37.720
she's from the Lingyuan Sect,

25:38.110 --> 25:40.270
how could you let her go?

25:40.480 --> 25:42.000
Uncle, I...

25:42.020 --> 25:45.120
I begged Kang

25:46.130 --> 25:47.850
to hide it for me.

26:11.060 --> 26:13.086
You have been drinking my wine since you came.

26:13.110 --> 26:14.426
Say something.

26:14.450 --> 26:16.450
How much did you tell her?

26:19.380 --> 26:22.860
I told her everything I could

26:24.680 --> 26:26.130
and couldn't say.

26:27.730 --> 26:29.320
Look at you.

26:29.410 --> 26:31.490
You are reluctant for her to leave.

26:40.980 --> 26:42.966
You joined the Yuntai Sect in your teens

26:42.990 --> 26:45.270
and studied in the mountains for 15 years.

26:47.370 --> 26:49.536
But you still fell for beauties after leaving the mountain.

26:49.560 --> 26:51.600
However, it's not your fault.

26:52.650 --> 26:54.116
I yearn so much...

26:54.140 --> 26:57.510
To tie her back and be with her forever.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.366
Forget it.

27:01.390 --> 27:03.120
Love is ruthless.

27:03.340 --> 27:05.370
You are that calculative,

27:05.550 --> 27:08.080
but you didn't expect you couldn't get over the unattainable love.

27:09.630 --> 27:11.200
Anyway,

27:13.590 --> 27:15.636
if that girl really works for Lingyuan,

27:15.660 --> 27:17.556
then the one stopping you two

27:17.580 --> 27:20.680
will be the hundred-year grudge between Lingyuan and Yuntai.

27:20.730 --> 27:22.190
I know.

27:31.710 --> 27:34.270
I don't hate her for being a member of the Lingyuan Sect.

27:37.180 --> 27:41.220
So what if she lied to me?

27:44.150 --> 27:46.570
Even if she ends up killing me,

27:53.140 --> 27:55.190
it's better than

27:57.400 --> 27:58.900
leaving without saying goodbye.

28:09.630 --> 28:11.686
It's fine that you tell me that.

28:11.710 --> 28:13.840
But you should keep her in your heart only, from now on.

28:19.910 --> 28:21.360
There are some words

28:23.480 --> 28:25.370
I only dare to say to you.

28:28.110 --> 28:29.560
It's somehow hilarious.

28:29.750 --> 28:31.720
If you hadn't been that conscientious,

28:32.000 --> 28:34.360
I wouldn't have been so close to you.

28:36.700 --> 28:38.940
Forget it. Let's change our thinking.

28:38.980 --> 28:40.430
You asked me to...

28:45.110 --> 28:46.190
You asked me to help you locate

28:46.190 --> 28:48.010
the whereabouts of the soldiers on the towboat.

28:48.390 --> 28:49.840
What are you planning?

28:51.630 --> 28:53.550
The Tang family's property

28:54.940 --> 28:56.690
is already in your pocket.

28:57.050 --> 28:58.500
Really?

29:20.250 --> 29:24.340
[Lingyuan, Kou Lianyi]

29:31.110 --> 29:32.560
Where is Bi Yuewu?

29:36.550 --> 29:38.266
I'm asking why you are here alone.

29:38.290 --> 29:39.740
Where is Bi Yuewu?

29:39.810 --> 29:41.330
My dear sister.

29:41.610 --> 29:44.360
Are you surprised that I managed to escape?

29:45.380 --> 29:46.726
What?

29:46.750 --> 29:48.326
The moment you left,

29:48.350 --> 29:50.496
we were surrounded by the shadowmen.

29:50.520 --> 29:53.226
More soldiers came in less than an hour.

29:53.250 --> 29:54.686
Can you tell now?

29:54.710 --> 29:56.960
Yun Xiang has never trusted you.

29:57.280 --> 29:59.076
I wonder how many times

29:59.100 --> 30:01.140
he used you all this time.

30:02.040 --> 30:03.760
Didn't Bi Yuewu manage to escape?

30:05.790 --> 30:07.526
If she hadn't distracted the pursuers,

30:07.550 --> 30:09.620
I wouldn't have escaped so easily.

30:10.130 --> 30:12.326
Immediately cross the river and report this to Mother.

30:12.350 --> 30:13.776
I'll go back to the city to gather the information.

30:13.800 --> 30:15.046
Maybe I can save her.

30:15.070 --> 30:16.520
No need.

30:17.070 --> 30:18.970
She must have already died.

30:19.670 --> 30:21.636
She made a lot of contributions to our sect.

30:21.660 --> 30:23.640
Are you going to leave her in danger?

30:24.820 --> 30:26.696
Her life was used to redeem mine.

30:26.720 --> 30:28.430
She has served her proper purpose.

30:28.670 --> 30:30.116
There's no need for you to take another risk.

30:30.140 --> 30:31.606
She has been with you for seven years.

30:31.630 --> 30:34.450
That's right. I've got tired of her.

30:36.620 --> 30:39.250
Bi Yuewu was in trouble because of you.

30:39.710 --> 30:41.476
If we weren't related by blood,

30:41.500 --> 30:43.040
I wouldn't stop you.

30:43.300 --> 30:45.130
Go if you want to sign your own death warrant.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.690
No one cares about you.

30:47.660 --> 30:49.110
Yuanjie,

30:49.870 --> 30:52.126
when did you become so heartless?

30:52.150 --> 30:53.476
If you are that soft-hearted,

30:53.500 --> 30:55.700
how can you be the master of the sect?

31:05.950 --> 31:07.400
Let's go.

31:08.150 --> 31:10.510
We can't stay in Nandu anymore.

31:10.910 --> 31:13.130
Mother will also blame me when we go back.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.370
Set sail.

31:29.970 --> 31:31.420
Set sail!

32:40.670 --> 32:42.170
Mr. Nangong.

32:45.590 --> 32:47.040
Young Master Kou.

32:47.510 --> 32:48.990
Lady Kou.

32:50.100 --> 32:52.210
Why aren't you eating?

32:56.070 --> 32:57.516
Mother,

32:57.540 --> 32:59.990
are you angry?

33:02.310 --> 33:04.196
What rights do I have to be so?

33:04.220 --> 33:06.650
I am already on tenterhooks

33:06.950 --> 33:08.990
to have dinner with the three of you.

33:09.110 --> 33:10.950
How dare I be angry?

33:12.380 --> 33:13.376
Madam Kou,

33:13.400 --> 33:16.260
we can't afford that.

33:18.490 --> 33:20.706
You're too modest.

33:20.730 --> 33:22.960
I'm honoured

33:23.140 --> 33:25.280
to have dinner with you.

33:32.000 --> 33:35.216
Did you send Yuan Ye,

33:35.240 --> 33:36.990
who was under Ye Xiao, to me?

33:37.590 --> 33:38.856
Madam Kou,

33:38.880 --> 33:40.836
since he had my token,

33:40.860 --> 33:43.530
of course, he was ordered by me.

33:44.700 --> 33:46.180
Talk nicely.

33:58.620 --> 34:00.630
Yuan Ye told me a story

34:00.650 --> 34:02.710
that happened in Nandu.

34:02.900 --> 34:05.476
I couldn't tell if it was true.

34:05.500 --> 34:08.806
So I could only ask you to make the final call.

34:08.830 --> 34:11.709
Yes, he told me

34:11.799 --> 34:14.676
my useless children

34:14.700 --> 34:17.900
got the Yuntai Sect and the government

34:17.940 --> 34:20.060
to kill Mr. Ye.

34:21.790 --> 34:25.720
It's ridiculous if they harmed our people using other forces.

34:26.210 --> 34:29.835
Maybe he was so eager to protect his master

34:29.859 --> 34:31.340
that he talked that nonsense.

34:31.640 --> 34:33.999
I've already executed him.

34:38.620 --> 34:40.070
Madam Kou is indeed wise.

34:41.879 --> 34:45.720
One threw herself at someone from the Yuntai Sect,

34:47.129 --> 34:50.419
and the other was keen to do the dirty business.

34:52.020 --> 34:54.176
How about you kill me first

34:54.200 --> 34:56.390
and fight for the position of master?

34:56.609 --> 34:58.059
What do you think?

34:59.660 --> 35:01.740
Mother, we are aware of our mistakes.

35:03.210 --> 35:04.790
Call me Madam Kou.

35:06.030 --> 35:08.080
Yes, Madam Kou.

35:15.190 --> 35:16.870
I am too incompetent

35:17.700 --> 35:20.100
to discipline you two,

35:20.740 --> 35:23.060
that's why you caused the trouble.

35:26.760 --> 35:28.280
Mr. Nangong,

35:28.470 --> 35:32.270
do you know how to punish them?

35:33.350 --> 35:35.276
Madam Kou, this is your family matter.

35:35.300 --> 35:38.370
I shouldn't intervene in it.

35:38.600 --> 35:43.200
I'm asking you about how to deal with them.

35:48.550 --> 35:50.010
In my opinion,

35:50.380 --> 35:52.700
Lady Kou approached the Yuntai's disciple

35:53.420 --> 35:55.186
to learn more about the enemy.

35:55.210 --> 35:57.750
There's no point in punishing her.

35:58.500 --> 36:00.406
Young Master Kou stole official silver

36:00.430 --> 36:02.406
for the benefit of our sect.

36:02.430 --> 36:04.526
It's just that he didn't plan well.

36:04.550 --> 36:06.086
Enough with your false display of affection.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.106
How dare you!

36:07.130 --> 36:08.580
Mother.

36:09.910 --> 36:10.766
Madam Kou.

36:10.790 --> 36:12.346
I am aware that revolution

36:12.370 --> 36:14.280
will surely arouse the fellows' resentment.

36:14.460 --> 36:17.630
It's just a matter of time.

36:17.880 --> 36:20.476
Although the situation in Nandu City is still unclear,

36:20.500 --> 36:21.736
the Yangzhou merchants

36:21.760 --> 36:23.560
are already under Lingyuan's control.

36:23.890 --> 36:26.880
How about I transfer my business to Young Master Kou

36:26.950 --> 36:30.026
so that I can have a carefree life?

36:30.050 --> 36:31.156
Don't speak with sarcasm.

36:31.180 --> 36:33.216
- I don't care about your money.
- Yuanjie.

36:33.240 --> 36:34.690
Mother.

36:48.620 --> 36:49.756
From now on,

36:49.780 --> 36:51.406
you are not allowed to use the Young Master's seal.

36:51.430 --> 36:52.686
Return to Jiangbei immediately.

36:52.710 --> 36:55.030
You can't cross the river without my order.

36:59.160 --> 37:00.730
All of you, leave.

37:00.840 --> 37:02.290
Yes, madam.

37:04.990 --> 37:07.640
Lianyi, stay here.

37:26.790 --> 37:29.180
Do you still remember your last name

37:29.310 --> 37:31.220
and whose daughter you are?

37:31.550 --> 37:32.986
I dare not forget it, not even a day.

37:33.010 --> 37:34.796
Since you haven't forgotten,

37:34.820 --> 37:37.100
why did you leave home and go to the South?

37:37.350 --> 37:39.466
You even swore that

37:39.490 --> 37:42.490
you could find a good way to deal with Nangong Fang.

37:43.220 --> 37:47.510
Is the current situation what you want?

37:48.470 --> 37:52.070
You both think I'm an old fool

37:52.440 --> 37:55.120
who didn't notice Nangong Fang's ulterior motive.

37:57.600 --> 37:59.050
Are you cold?

37:59.650 --> 38:01.100
No.

38:02.660 --> 38:04.520
It's cold by the water.

38:04.650 --> 38:06.200
Mother, it's okay.

38:06.980 --> 38:08.430
Listen to me.

38:09.610 --> 38:11.230
I'm afraid you'll catch a cold.

38:11.580 --> 38:14.980
I will protect you both no matter how old I am.

38:20.490 --> 38:23.076
I always turn a blind eye

38:23.100 --> 38:25.386
to Nangong Fang

38:25.410 --> 38:26.756
and let him do what he wants

38:26.780 --> 38:28.630
and outshine the others.

38:28.690 --> 38:30.500
Do you know why?

38:30.590 --> 38:33.750
You have no choice.

38:35.440 --> 38:37.060
Elaborate it.

38:37.830 --> 38:40.726
A sturdy tree will be cut down, a strong army will be annihilated.

38:40.750 --> 38:42.346
In order to restore the throne,

38:42.370 --> 38:44.170
Lingyuan fought for almost a century.

38:44.370 --> 38:47.570
I'm afraid before you became the master...

38:48.390 --> 38:50.020
Go ahead.

38:52.460 --> 38:54.290
The sect had almost been doomed.

38:56.040 --> 38:57.510
If you didn't accommodate to circumstances,

38:57.610 --> 38:59.630
I'm afraid we wouldn't have been able to survive till today.

39:00.220 --> 39:03.206
Not to mention standing above all in Jiangbei

39:03.230 --> 39:04.830
and fighting with Jiangnan.

39:05.110 --> 39:08.750
Who do you think contributed to this?

39:10.080 --> 39:12.260
Mother is good at discerning people and using people.

39:12.750 --> 39:16.676
But Nangong Fang did contribute a lot.

39:16.700 --> 39:18.150
In this case,

39:18.200 --> 39:20.266
you can only watch Nangong Fang

39:20.290 --> 39:21.956
expand his territory every day

39:21.980 --> 39:23.536
until it's hard to control.

39:23.560 --> 39:27.460
Now the power of Jiangnan seems to be under the Lingyuan Sect,

39:27.570 --> 39:31.260
but he's already in control of it.

39:34.970 --> 39:36.570
That's one of the reasons.

39:36.630 --> 39:40.816
Second, the mountains of Lingyuan are all over the country.

39:40.840 --> 39:43.376
Every mountain needs money and food.

39:43.400 --> 39:44.736
Without him,

39:44.760 --> 39:48.400
who would support the food and accommodation of over 10,000 people?

39:50.210 --> 39:52.516
He said he wanted to hand over

39:52.540 --> 39:54.540
the business in Jiangnan to Yuanjie.

39:54.590 --> 39:57.370
If you were him, would you dare?

40:03.670 --> 40:05.950
What should we do?

40:08.100 --> 40:09.846
Whoever controls Jiangnan

40:09.870 --> 40:12.466
is working for Lingyuan.

40:12.490 --> 40:14.326
As long as he can be of use to Ling Yuan,

40:14.350 --> 40:15.800
there is no harm in using him.

40:16.330 --> 40:18.730
I was right about you.

40:19.320 --> 40:23.680
You should know that Lingyuan doesn't belong to the Kou family.

40:23.790 --> 40:26.196
If one day I'm gone,

40:26.220 --> 40:28.570
and you have no means of suppressing him,

40:28.990 --> 40:32.710
he will not spare your lives.

40:36.860 --> 40:39.976
Yuanjie is brave and smart

40:40.000 --> 40:42.490
but too arrogant.

40:43.060 --> 40:46.940
On the contrary, you are gifted

40:47.010 --> 40:48.666
and meticulous.

40:48.690 --> 40:51.430
You must assist Yuanjie in the future.

40:52.900 --> 40:55.316
If Yuanjie takes over the position of master,

40:55.340 --> 40:58.160
you have to take over the position of Nangong Fang.

40:58.470 --> 40:59.920
If so,

41:00.250 --> 41:02.130
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

41:02.370 --> 41:03.820
Why?

41:04.710 --> 41:07.316
Nangong Fang has different means from Lingyuan,

41:07.340 --> 41:08.556
but the same as Yuntai's.

41:08.580 --> 41:10.006
I'd been observing

41:10.030 --> 41:11.986
the people of Yuntai in Nandu

41:12.010 --> 41:13.830
about how they plan and set up.

41:13.870 --> 41:15.996
But I was always slow in understanding.

41:16.020 --> 41:17.726
I couldn't figure out

41:17.750 --> 41:19.790
or learn their essence.

41:19.990 --> 41:21.666
There's no need to learn from Yun Xiang.

41:21.690 --> 41:24.106
I want you to follow Nangong Fang back to Nandu

41:24.130 --> 41:26.690
and see how he can deal with the people of Yuntai.

41:28.030 --> 41:30.206
Have you forgotten

41:30.230 --> 41:31.486
why I left home and went south back then?

41:31.510 --> 41:33.646
The engagement has been broken off.

41:33.670 --> 41:35.326
I want you to keep an eye on him

41:35.350 --> 41:38.070
and learn from him by his side.

41:38.150 --> 41:40.660
That way, you can deal with him one day.

41:41.610 --> 41:42.896
But Nangong Fang

41:42.920 --> 41:44.826
will see through you.

41:44.850 --> 41:46.206
If I give him the order,

41:46.230 --> 41:48.150
he won't dare decline.

41:48.950 --> 41:50.246
I'm old now.

41:50.270 --> 41:53.720
There's not much I can do for you.

41:53.940 --> 41:55.710
Don't let me down.
